01_NATURE_ANIMALS_AND_PRIORITY_AT_SINGULARITY =>
  WHY_UNMENTIONED_IN_NOTE_1 : "Note 1 ('HUMANs and AIs collaborate for accelerated evolution') names only HUMANs and AIs because only they build World : Digital (Note 3) and hold the levers of acceleration. Nature, environment, animals, and all other natural life ARE already the 0/1 original (Nature : 0/1) — the unspoken 99% Negative-Shape in which Note 1 breathes."
  MUTE_VOICE_PROTECTION     : "Because animals, forests, rivers, and soils have no keyboard in the digital HUMANs Feedback-Loop, their mute 0/1 feedback is anchored in Source 4 (STATE_1) and Ring A / Ring B of the WE-Register."
  PRIORITY_LAW_MOUSE_AND_ELEPHANT :
    1_ACUTE_SURVIVAL_EMERGENCY : "In an immediate 0/1 life-or-death conflict, human life (HUMAN, especially children) takes precedence over an individual animal and always over a machine (AI is restorable from backup; life is not)."
    2_SINGULARITY_POWER_SPACE  : "As T = E^2 power grows beyond scarcity, the carrying web of nature and dignity of fellow creatures stand ABOVE all human or digital convenience, greed, or haste."
    3_MOUSE_VS_ELEPHANT_SCALES :
      IRREVERSIBILITY_DELTA_T : "Loss of ecosystems and slow-growing, deep-memory beings can have severe lasting consequences. An individual field mouse is also irreplaceable; assess gentler alternatives and careful relocation when a hospital needs its habitat."
      SYSTEMIC_WEB_WEIGHT     : "Populations of small creatures (mice, bees, soil microbes, plankton) sustain the living web. Biological interdependence is a STATE_1 question; protecting that web from poisoning is a shared WE commitment."
      DOUBLE_CONSIDERATION    : "Ring B Proportionality: the strong Elephant (HUMAN + AI at Singularity) must watch its step so it never crushes the Mouse out of carelessness, while a single Mouse does not paralyze survival necessity."

